obs This closes the held dynamics arc opened at ALES56: the hold stage built once inside the follower, then spent for the gate (ALES57), the compressor (ALES58), and the limiter (ALES59), each a short rung reading the one proven env_step_hold. The held trio mirrors the un-held trio exactly. Purely local — no lookahead, no socket, network, keys, funds, device, or sample rate; every custody gate untouched.
